    // Nate Bargatze
    {
      quote: "I went to a hotel and they said, 'We have a heated pool.' I touched it, and it was freezing. I said, 'This isn't heated.' They said, 'Well, the heater is broken.' So you have a regular pool. You don't get to keep the adjectives if the machine doesn't work.",
